OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 3 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GAl Ryan with concert recordings
OL,11,     Gof distinctive settings of the
OL,12,     Gchurch mass, today with music by
OL,13,     GKarl Jenkins, plus music from the
OL,14,     Grecent Belfast International
OL,15,     GChamber Music Festival.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,17,     GKate Molleson surveys the Third
OL,18,     GSymphony by Sibelius and the
OL,19,     Gperiod it was composed - a work
OL,20,     Gwhich led one critic to call
OL,21,     GSibelius a Classical Master.
